I have an AlphaStation 255. Using OSS, I can get sound (with either 2.4
or 2.6 kernels) by using

alias sound-slot-0 ad1848
options ad1848 io=0x530 irq=9 dma=3

in the appropriate config file. However, when using

alias sound-slot-0 snd-ad1848
options snd-ad1848 port=0x530 irq=9 dma1=3

