=46rom your post, you're trying to install sarge, not woody.  If you are tr=
ying
to install woody, I would refer you to the installation manual for that
version.  You will not be able to boot a sarge CD on this system, however,
unless you flash your system to use SRM instead of AlphaBIOS.  (Your analogy
