runs
=93ash=94 using an editor called =93nano=94.  It explains that =93the =
root file
system is a RAM disk=94.  Also =93the hard disk file systems are mounted =
on
=91/target=92=94.  However, once there I do not know how to find or run =
FDISK.

=20

So what?

=20

